flowchart TB
    Q([Treasury Bulletin question]) --> M{{Manager}}
    M -->|delegate: find figures| R[Researcher]
    M -->|delegate: compute| C[Calculator]
    R -->|figures| M
    C -->|result| M
    M -->|synthesize| Out([Answer + FINAL_ANSWER])

    R -.-> rt[list / search / read]
    C -.-> ct[compute]
